OL,3,AProminent Russian newspaper shuts down
OL,4,Aunder pressure from authorities
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the last three decades, Novaya
OL,7,FGazeta has been one of the most
OL,8,Fhigh-profile independent news outlets
OL,9,Fin Russia.
OL,11,FNow it's shutting down - and it has
OL,12,Faccused the Russian authorities of the
OL,13,F"murder" of a newspaper.
OL,15,F"They've killed us," reads a statement
OL,16,Fon the Novaya Gazeta website.
OL,18,F"The newspaper is no more. The Russian
OL,19,Fauthorities and Russian special
OL,20,Fservices have forced the paper to stop
OL,21,Fits work."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
